      "content": "Phase 1 discovery is complete. Key surviving entities:\n\n- **Tables**: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED, ACADEMIC_TERMS, ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL, SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY, SUBJECT_SUMMARY, TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SIS_DEPARTMENT, LIBRARY_RESERVE_MATRL_DETAIL\n- **Metrics**: dw_1301 (near-identical shape), dw_4701, dw_1023, dw_4812, dw_3356, dw_4724\n- **Concepts**: concept_subject_offering_facts, concept_academic_term_dimension, concept_course_material_programs, concept_department_dimension\n- **Column Concepts**: column_concept_enrollment_measures, column_concept_year_columns, column_concept_department_name, column_concept_term_code, column_concept_subject_id\n\nNow Phase 2 — investigating the most relevant entities:\n\n",
